+    `csv.DictReader`, so every weight arrives as `str`. Ungated this raised a bare
+    `TypeError` from `sum`, with no `code` for a diagnostic to print."""
+    assert kish_effective_n(["1", "1.0", "1", "3"]) == pytest.approx(3.0)
